    ],
    "source_pages": [
      29
    ],
    "text": "In order to know what we should do in this complex situation, we \ufb01rst con- struct several models to study the effect of space junk on several basic assump- tions. From the analysis of the results, we \ufb01nd that the space will only contain space junk in the next few decade. We also \ufb01nd that with the ODR(Orbital De- bris Removal) system,it will take about 50- 60 years for the numbers of satellites to decrease. Additionally, launching specialized cleaners may be a better idea."
  },
